DESCRIPTION:description: Our annual boat party returns for 2026 to continue
  our tradition of mincing down the River Thames for BOATMINCE! ⚓️🛳 Come on
  board to be surrounded by seamen\, burly captains and cabin boys on board 
 HMS BOATMINCE for an afternoon of fun on the Thames. BEARS AND BUOYS AHOY! 
 👀 We board The Jewel of London 12\\:15pm sharp from the Westminster Pier! 
 Please don’t be late as the captain will not wait for late gays. We will di
 sembark at 5pm. You know we love it when you make an effort to dress up so 
 we STRONGLY encourage a nautical theme. Throw me a wave\, sailor! 🏳️‍🌈 Th
 e Jewel of London is bespoke party boat with two large decks\, open sunroof
  and viewing gallery. It has two outside decks one to the front and one to 
 the rear. On board is a superb sound system\, perfect for those summer tune
 s ☀️☀️ During the four hours of cruising (on the boat!) DJs Silverhook\, Ch
 ris Brogan & Jon Byrne will be delivering the signature BEEFMINCE sound\, b
 ut carefully re-adjusted for a delightful (but yet boozy) afternoon. PLUS n
 o need to take Monday off work\, it's a Bank Holiday bbz!\nbar: Westminster
  Pier\naddress: Victoria Embankment\, London SW1A 2JH\nimage: https://dice-
 media.imgix.net/attachments/2025-01-15/aa1288a2-6cf8-4c42-8c29-581b1cfe5ba2
 .jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C768%2C768\ntimezone: Europe/London\ncover: £30.06\nimageH
